OL,3,AUS prices remain high as fuel costs
OL,4,Asqueeze household budgets
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrices in the US rose by 3.4% in the
OL,7,Fyear to August, with the cost of living
OL,8,Fpushed up by higher gasoline prices,
OL,9,Fofficial figures show.
OL,11,FThe overall inflation rate was
OL,12,Funchanged from July, according to the
OL,13,FBureau of Labor Statistics (BLS).
OL,15,FIt comes ahead of the Federal Reserve
OL,16,Fmaking its latest interest rate
OL,17,Fdecision next week, with growing
OL,18,Fexpectations they will be increased in
OL,19,Fa bid to slow the rate at which prices
OL,20,Fare rising.
