OL,3,AUS prices remain high as fuel costs
OL,4,Asqueeze household budgets
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS household budgets have come under
OL,7,Fmounting pressure, especially at the
OL,8,Ffuel pumps, with a gallon of diesel
OL,9,Fhitting a new all-time high of more
OL,10,Fthan $6 on average on Friday.
